# Monte-Carlo config, read from stdin: bin/simu_montecarlo < configs/config_montecarlo
# One "<key> <value>" pair per line; lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#   iter  number of MC steps (one crankshaft or pivot trial each)
#   N     number of monomers (unit bond length)
#   T     temperature; moves accepted with prob min(1, exp(-dE/T))
#   lp    bending stiffness: E = lp/2 sum_n |u_n - u_{n-1}|^2 = lp sum_n (1 - cos theta_n)
#   dump  write energy and configuration (pol.xyz, in the cwd) every dump steps
#   seed  GSL mt19937 seed (optional, default 12345)
iter	10000
N	100
T	1
lp	3
dump 	10
seed	12345
